\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Per-subsystem latency at $p_{50}$ (blue bars) and $p_{95}$ (orange bars). Cognitive Arbitration (the LangChain ReAct LLM forward pass) dominates at 62.2\% of total loop time. Diagnostic Traversal (Prometheus range-query + graph BFS) is the second largest contributor at 19.2\%.}}{9}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:latency}{{5}{9}{Per-subsystem latency at $p_{50}$ (blue bars) and $p_{95}$ (orange bars). Cognitive Arbitration (the LangChain ReAct LLM forward pass) dominates at 62.2\% of total loop time. Diagnostic Traversal (Prometheus range-query + graph BFS) is the second largest contributor at 19.2\%}{figure.5}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Break-even sensitivity analysis as a function of MTTA (min). Left axis (blue): probability that \textsc  {HealOps}{} resolves the fault before on-call SRE acknowledgment. Right axis (orange): estimated operational cost reduction based on \$200/hr SRE cost, 4 incidents/week, 3-person rotation. The 95\% probability threshold is crossed at MTTA $\approx $ 2\,min.}}{9}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:breakeven}{{6}{9}{Break-even sensitivity analysis as a function of MTTA (min). Left axis (blue): probability that \HealOps {} resolves the fault before on-call SRE acknowledgment. Right axis (orange): estimated operational cost reduction based on \$200/hr SRE cost, 4 incidents/week, 3-person rotation. The 95\% probability threshold is crossed at MTTA $\approx $ 2\,min}{figure.6}{}}
